{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"scripts/quality_gates.sh","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:18:39.907614Z","id":"1c87cb4b70bdd4ef0c43c90e7eaef41107511e2660ea08745fedf0422234ea1e","body":{"detail":"They run first, alone, because several were timing-sensitive. Since 508ebe9 the view-mounting and child-process tests run under limits that end hangs only (MOUNT_TIMEOUT_MS 30 s, CHILD_TIMEOUT_MS 60 s, web/shell/src/test/timeouts.ts), so moving them into the lanes would save about 9 s of a gates run.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":176},"end":{"line":183},"content_hash":"6115d495e619e1d116c1414158a591fcebd9d0f284301f6a25e22ad6a444938d"},"summary":"The shell's unit tests run alone (about 9 s); they may now join the lanes","supersedes":"3042ce81872845c5752e79c9830d948f190a9b3754190b81f8da227cd6d0bf17","tags":["gate-speed","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"scripts/quality_gates.sh","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:42:55.916146Z","id":"21bdd62492dbc4bb01247d6e3257b3341c39063bf0880b02eb5c881ae7e123f3","body":{"detail":"test-repos.mjs needs jj (CLAX_TEST_JJ or jj on PATH) and fails without it; no gate installs one. After commit cfe9fdaa it passes with CLAX_TEST_JJ set (node test-repos.mjs --no-build: every check ok). The e2e lane's node e2e.mjs now publishes into git through the stand-in (REPO_STORE=memory) but does not clone.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":158},"end":{"line":165},"content_hash":"b307cd78ca40244b0f066e84429c5be8f1d9fc44367795b203ac88b7d8c11c78"},"summary":"The worker lane does not run crates/clax-worker/test-repos.mjs (the RepoDO stand-in, /git/ clones and pushes, R2 assets)","tags":["worker","gates","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
